WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.940
To set up the SIM card, right-click then left-click the square, and close all open tabs.

00:07.940 --> 00:14.500
Click Settings, then "Network & Internet", and then "Mobile network".

00:14.500 --> 00:22.500
Enable the "Home" carrier option and click OK to activate. Then open "Advanced".

00:22.500 --> 00:26.900
Go to "Access Point Names" (APN).

00:26.900 --> 00:36.560
Tap "+" to create a new APN. In the "Name" field, enter the following tag:

00:36.560 --> 00:54.900
ipv4.br — copy this value and paste it also in the "APN" field right below.

00:54.900 --> 01:01.000
After that, tap the three dots in the top right corner and select "Save".

01:01.000 --> 01:09.300
Activate the APN (check the circle) and reopen the rental app.

01:09.300 --> 01:15.540
Look at the top-right corner: the "LTE" label will appear, meaning the SIM was recognized.

01:15.540 --> 01:23.140
Done! Remove the mouse and the station is online using the SIM card.
